      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can't edit post, but I would like to clarify some things:\n\n- In this post, I talk about \"fallback\" avatars, but I actually meant to refer to people showing up as Impostors. The option to view avatar details is only usable in the main menu and not the quick menu when someone is in an Impostor. This is core issue this post was meant to address.\n\n- When someone is actually in a fallback avatar, viewing the avatar stats shows you the stats of the fallback avatar they are in, not the actual avatar they are wearing, so there is no way to know how bad that avatar truly is unless you manually show it. This is another thing I would like addressed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
