  "details": "The option is grayed out in the quick menu, but if you click on their profile, the option is there and is clickable. It will then show the stats for their real avatar, which is very useful to figure out *why* they are showing up as a fallback, without actually having to show their avatar.\n\nI'd like it if the option was usable in the quick menu.",
